      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Moving with a professional packer in Mangalore begins with a meticulous pre‑move assessment. The first step is a video or in‑person survey of your home, where the team documents the size of rooms, the number of large items, and any fragile or high‑value pieces.</p>
<p>This audit allows the company to design a custom packing plan, estimate the required truck capacity, and identify potential logistical hurdles such as narrow stairways or limited parking.</p>

<p>Once the survey is complete, the actual packing starts room by room. The crew follows a systematic sequence: bedrooms, kitchen, living areas, and storage spaces. Each step includes:</p><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
